Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.79,0:03:19.71,Title,0,0,0,0,,《猩球崛起2：黎明之战》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.60,0:01:04.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你有发烧 咳嗽 喉咙痛等症状{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you have a fever and cough or sore throat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.47,0:01:06.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,请留在家中{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.10,0:01:09.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,要我说这有95%的可能是实验室搞出来的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd say 95% chance this is manufactured came out of a laboratory.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.31,0:01:10.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,病源可追溯到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The source of the virus was traced back to{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.76,0:01:14.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,在旧金山创维实验室所做的药物检测{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}drug testing done at gen-sys laboratories in San Francisco.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.65,0:01:16.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,目前认定的首位感染者是实验室技术人员{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The lab technician now known as patient zero{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.86,0:01:19.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,他意外接触到了ALZ-113逆转录酶病毒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}was accidentally exposed to retrovirus alz-113, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.52,0:01:22.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是种针对阿兹海默症的试用药物{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}an Alzheimer's trial drug{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.05,0:01:23.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,当时正用黑猩猩来做试验{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}that was being tested on chimpanzees.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.83,0:01:24.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,受到感染的黑猩猩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The infected chimps{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.88,0:01:28.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,表现出了不稳定性并伴有攻击行为{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}showed signs of erratic and aggressive behavior{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.03,0:01:29.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,最终导致它们逃离了实验室{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}that led to their escape from the facility.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.12,0:01:31.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,金门大桥上的事件现在已经众所周知{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The now-famous incident on the golden gate bridge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.14,0:01:33.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,黑猩猩与警方对峙了6小时{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A six-hour standoff with police.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.55,0:01:36.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,最终消失在了红木森林中{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ended with the apes disappearing into muir woods.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.21,0:01:38.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,急诊室已经不堪重负{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Emergency rooms are being overwhelmed with{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.09,0:01:41.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,挤满了出现「猿流感」征兆的患者{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}patients showing signs of what's being dubbed "The simian flu."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.89,0:01:43.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,疾病控制中心预测{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The CDC is projecting a fatality toll{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.45,0:01:45.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,未来六到八个月{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}ranging from 5 million{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.13,0:01:49.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,死亡人数将从五百万增至一亿五千万{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to as many as 150 million in the next 6 to 8 months.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.14,0:01:53.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,出现感染症状的人都会得到特殊治疗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyone showing signs of a contagious illness will receive special treatment here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.05,0:01:56.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,机场已专门建立了检疫中心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The airport's purpose-built quarantine center.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.32,0:01:57.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,许多新来者{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Many of the new arrivals are{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.67,0:02:00.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是与父母失去联系的孩子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}children who have lost contact with their parents.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.41,0:02:03.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,强制隔离措施引发了国内骚乱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The mandatory quarantines have sparked civil unrest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.03,0:02:05.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,很多家庭因此被拆散{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Families are being ripped apart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.08,0:02:06.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,隔离不太可能有效{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Containment is not very likely.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.75,0:02:09.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟你的家人做好准备 熟悉逃生路线{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prepare your families. Know your evacuation route.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.54,0:02:13.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,目前的存活率约为五百分之一{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The survival rate is now approximately 1 in 500.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.08,0:02:15.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚在市中心发生了暴力冲突{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Violence erupted in the city center tonight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.34,0:02:16.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,这已是这些天的来第三起暴力事件{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The third incident in as many days.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.84,0:02:19.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,已有28个国家宣布进入戒严状态{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Martial law has been declared in 28 nations, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.38,0:02:21.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,包括美国和加拿大{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}including the U.S. And Canada.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.26,0:02:23.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,核反应堆过热 我们阻止不了它熔毁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The reactor is overheating. We can't stop a meltdown.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.55,0:02:28.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,民众秩序完全陷入了混乱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just a total collapse of anything resembling civilian order.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.93,0:02:31.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,由于猿流感肆虐成风{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Due to the extremity of the simian flu crisis, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.05,0:02:35.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有的政府职能部门都已无限期关闭{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}all regular government functions have been suspended indefinitely.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.40,0:02:40.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些没被病毒杀死的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those who aren't killed by the virus, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.61,0:02:42.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许会死在斗争中{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}will probably die in the fighting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.57,0:02:46.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许就这样了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, maybe this is it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.87,0:02:49.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是结束{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is how it ends.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.08,0:02:50.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,很快{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pretty soon, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.79,0:02:53.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,人类就会灭绝了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}there won't be anyone left.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.40,0:04:00.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯撒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Caesar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.82,0:04:02.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们在靠近{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They are close.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.86,0:04:06.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,科巴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Koba!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.80,0:04:28.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在动手吗 父亲{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, father?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.20,0:05:34.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,儿子 别动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Son, stay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.74,0:06:54.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 科巴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, koba.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.85,0:07:18.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,儿子 要三思而后行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think before you act, son.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.25,0:08:25.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,别不开心了 蓝瞳{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't feel bad, Blue Eyes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.71,0:08:31.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,受伤能让你变得更强{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Scars make you strong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.73,0:10:51.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来看看你的弟弟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come meet your new brother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.87,0:11:09.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,又一个儿子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Another son.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.79,0:11:17.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,不禁感叹我们已经走多久了 莫里斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Makes me think how far we've come, Maurice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.97,0:11:24.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,貌似很久了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seems long ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.52,0:11:31.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,还会想他们吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still think about them?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.02,0:11:33.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,人类吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Humans?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.52,0:11:38.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,有时候会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sometimes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.07,0:11:43.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有像你那样了解过他们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Didn't know them like you did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.95,0:11:48.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只看到他们坏的一面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only saw their bad side.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.08,0:11:53.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 坏的 现在都不重要了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good, bad. doesn't matter now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.75,0:11:56.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,人类自己毁灭了自己{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Humans destroyed each other.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.88,0:11:59.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,咱们也会打架啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apes fight too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.63,0:12:02.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,但咱们是一家人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we are family.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.10,0:12:12.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,真想知道他们是不是真的都不在了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wonder if they're really all gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.77,0:12:15.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,都过了10个冬天了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ten winters now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.48,0:12:19.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,上两个冬天就不见他们的踪迹了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Last two, no sign of them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.19,0:12:22.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们肯定都不在了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They must be gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.02,0:12:56.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,蓝瞳 换我就不会被那熊伤到 我多快啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That bear wouldn't get me, blue eyes. I'm quick!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.31,0:12:59.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴 嘘{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up, ash!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.45,0:13:11.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.12,0:13:13.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.55,0:13:27.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事的 没事的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay. It's okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.72,0:13:28.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,别动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Freeze!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.73,0:13:44.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,别动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.90,0:13:46.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮忙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.82,0:13:48.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,快来帮忙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.49,0:13:49.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,不许动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.91,0:13:54.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Over here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.41,0:13:59.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我打中他了 我打中他了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I shot him! I shot him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.03,0:14:33.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们打中了灰灰 他们打了我儿子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They shot ash! Shot my son!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.78,0:14:37.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,火箭 先等等{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rocket, wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.08,0:14:45.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们无意伤害你们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't mean any harm!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.25,0:14:49.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们可是猩猩 怎么会听懂你说什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're apes, man. You think they understand what you're saying?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.38,0:14:52.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得他们只是普通猩猩吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do they look like just apes to you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.82,0:15:06.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.82,0:15:07.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,马尔科姆 你干什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Malcolm, what are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.82,0:15:09.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 爸爸 - 马尔科姆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dad? - Malcolm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.24,0:15:10.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.66,0:15:17.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,把枪放下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put your guns down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.49,0:15:19.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 说什么呢 - 放下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You can't be serious. - Do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.92,0:15:30.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,滚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.13,0:15:33.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holy shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.26,0:15:34.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holy shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.85,0:15:39.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 我们马上走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Okay, we're going.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.52,0:15:40.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,滚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.02,0:15:42.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 慢点 - 快走 走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Slowly. - Go, go, go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.86,0:15:48.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的包{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My bag!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.28,0:15:49.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.96,0:16:11.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,科巴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Koba!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.09,0:16:14.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟着他们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Follow!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.10,0:17:01.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到了吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you find it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.18,0:17:03.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得谈谈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to talk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.02,0:17:06.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了 什么事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? What's wrong?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.77,0:17:10.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,水坝几乎是完好的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The dam is pretty much intact.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.27,0:17:12.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,估计一周内就能开始为我们提供能源{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It could probably start generating power for us within a week.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.69,0:17:14.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,但有个问题 上车再说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But there is a problem. Get in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.37,0:17:27.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我打中他了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I shot him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.17,0:17:29.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很害怕 不知道该怎么做{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was scared. I didn't know what to do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.71,0:17:32.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 那里有多少只{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus Christ. How many were there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.88,0:17:34.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,很多 大概80只{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A lot. Like, 80.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.13,0:17:35.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 至少80只 - 好了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- At least. - Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.47,0:17:39.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你都没听到他说什么 他们会说话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not hearing what he's saying. They spoke!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.39,0:17:40.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不可能{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is not possible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.97,0:17:42.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟你说 德雷福斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm telling you, Dreyfus, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.21,0:17:42.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们确实会说话 非常惊人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}they did and it was incredible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.01,0:17:45.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,惊人 他们是会说话的猩猩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Incredible? They're talking apes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.89,0:17:48.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 还他妈带着长矛 - 得了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- With big-ass Spears! - Please!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.06,0:17:51.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道你认为自己看见或听到了什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know exactly what you think you saw or heard, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.57,0:17:54.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你得给我安静下来 好吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you have to calm down, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.86,0:17:57.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,病毒方面呢 埃莉 有任何进展吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about the virus, Ellie? Any chance of contagion?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.99,0:17:59.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是因为基因免疫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're all genetically immune, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.33,0:18:01.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然早就死了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}or we would've been dead a long time ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.32,0:18:02.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,这你可不能确定{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't know that for sure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.70,0:18:04.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是疾控中心的 她怎么不确定{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She worked with the CDC. She knows.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.16,0:18:05.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们怎么办{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are we gonna do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.16,0:18:06.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.16,0:18:08.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要那里的能源{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need that power.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.04,0:18:11.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,他本可以杀死我们 但他没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He could've killed us, but he didn't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.17,0:18:13.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许他故意留我们小命 好跟踪我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe he kept us alive, so they could follow us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.88,0:18:16.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到我们所在 再一举杀光{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They find out where we are, and they kill us all!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.01,0:18:18.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,「他」 是指谁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean, "He"?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.38,0:18:20.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是我们想告诉你的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what we're trying to tell you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.18,0:18:21.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你绝对前所未见{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was unlike anything you've ever seen before, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.35,0:18:23.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们的首领{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the leader…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.47,0:18:25.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,绝对非同寻常{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was remarkable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.89,0:18:26.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.31,0:18:29.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你是这么想的吗 - 这是我们看到的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Is that what you thought? - It's what we saw.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.19,0:18:30.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 我们都看到的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, it's what we all saw.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.52,0:18:32.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,回去不能再提及此事 懂吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not a word of this back at the colony, you understand me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.98,0:18:34.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,在没想出办法前一句话也不能提{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not a word until we can figure out what to do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.90,0:18:37.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 开什么玩笑 - 我不是在开玩笑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You gotta be kidding. - No, I'm not kidding.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.74,0:18:40.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想制造恐慌{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want to create a panic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.38,0:19:01.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么样 伙计 你还好吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How are you doing, pal? Are you okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.72,0:19:03.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我的包掉了 - 我知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I dropped my bag. - I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.72,0:19:05.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你的写生本也在里边吗 - 没了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Was your sketchbook in there? - It's gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.01,0:19:07.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡弗刚跟我说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carver just told me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.25,0:19:09.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能跟任何人提起那里发生了什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}we're not gonna tell anybody what happened up there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.27,0:19:10.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,暂时先别说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not yet. No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.30,0:19:39.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须现在就打过去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Must attack them now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.26,0:19:42.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,以防他们先动手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before they attack us!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.88,0:19:44.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不知道他们有多少人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't know how many there are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.22,0:19:47.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,有多少枪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many guns they have?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.43,0:19:51.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,也不知道他们来这里干什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or why they came up here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.53,0:20:01.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们开枪打了你儿子 火箭{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They shot your son, Rocket!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.90,0:20:03.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,难道你不想报仇吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you want to fight?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.53,0:20:07.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听凯撒的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I follow Caesar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.37,0:20:10.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,科巴说得没错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Koba's right!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.62,0:20:14.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们差点杀了你 灰灰{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They almost killed you, ash!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.75,0:20:21.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.39,0:20:28.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果挑起战争{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we go to war, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.01,0:20:32.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可能会失去这些年来建立的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}we could lose all we've built…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.56,0:20:36.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,家园{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.15,0:20:40.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,家人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Family.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.99,0:20:50.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,未来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Future.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.21,0:21:00.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,明早之前我会作出决定{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will decide by morning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.81,0:21:12.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯撒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Caesar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.31,0:21:22.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,多年来我一直被人类囚禁在实验室{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}For years I was a prisoner in their lab.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.82,0:21:24.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们拿我开刀{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They cut me, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.49,0:21:25.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,不断地折磨我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}tortured me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.91,0:21:29.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你救了我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You freed me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.91,0:21:34.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以为你做任何事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would do anything you ask.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.08,0:21:38.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们必须展示实力{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we must show strength!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.42,0:21:43.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会的 科巴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will, koba.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.21,0:22:28.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,借过 借过{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Coming through. Coming through.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.45,0:22:52.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,这他妈可远不只80啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a hell of a lot more than eighty!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.35,0:23:22.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,马尔科姆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Malcolm!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.34,0:23:54.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,猿族{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apes{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.56,0:24:00.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,不想要战争{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}do not want war.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.35,0:24:04.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,但若有必要{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But will fight, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.69,0:24:08.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们定将战斗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}if we must.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.56,0:24:43.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,猿族的家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ape home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.06,0:24:49.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,人类的家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Human home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.11,0:24:57.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要再过来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do not come back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.99,0:25:38.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.82,0:25:43.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位 你们得冷静{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone, you have to calm down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.84,0:25:51.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.46,0:25:54.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.63,0:25:58.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,请冷静 我们都是免疫的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please! We're all immune!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.47,0:26:02.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都免疫 不然也不会站在这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're all immune, or we wouldn't still be here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.01,0:26:04.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们怎么找到这的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did they find us?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.98,0:26:07.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我们先找到他们的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We found them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.10,0:26:08.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道他们在哪里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You knew they were out there!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.17,0:26:09.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,万一他们回来怎么办{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if they come back?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.61,0:26:14.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是他们回来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If they come back, if they come back, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.44,0:26:17.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们一定会后悔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}they'll be sorry they ever did!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.15,0:26:20.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,尽管现在这座城市的人口不复当年{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, this city may not have the manpower it once did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.78,0:26:23.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,但它还拥有火力{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it has the firepower.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.33,0:26:26.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,身后那批武器弹药{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those stockpiles left behind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.45,0:26:29.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,联邦应急管理局的 国民警卫队的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}By fema, the national guard, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.60,0:26:31.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在都归我们了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}we have it all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.21,0:26:33.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.63,0:26:37.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你们为什么害怕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know why you're scared.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.84,0:26:41.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我 我也害怕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm scared, too, believe me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.05,0:26:45.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我知道自己身上背负着你们的信任{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I recognize the trust you've all placed in me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.93,0:26:48.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们一起闯过鬼门关{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've been through hell together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.35,0:26:54.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们也都知道现在我们面临着什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you all know what we're up against.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.28,0:27:00.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,燃料快用完了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're almost out of fuel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.91,0:27:03.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,这意味着提供不了电力{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which means no more power.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.53,0:27:07.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,意味着我们要过回以前的苦日子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which means we could slip back to the way things were.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.20,0:27:11.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,而那边的水坝就是解决方案{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That dam up there was the answer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.54,0:27:15.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是我们没想到他们也在那边{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We just had no idea they were up there, too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.46,0:27:16.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,那现在该怎么办{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what do we do now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.55,0:27:18.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.88,0:27:21.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会想别的办法{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We find another way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.26,0:27:25.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为那里的电力{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because that power{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.72,0:27:27.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,不仅仅能使灯泡发光{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}is not just about keeping the lights on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.72,0:27:30.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,还能为我们提供工具{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's about giving us the tools, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.27,0:27:32.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,与外面的世界重新取得联系{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to reconnect to the rest of the world, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.77,0:27:35.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到外面的同伴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}To find out who else is out there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.82,0:27:40.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样我们就能开始重建{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So that we can start to rebuild, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.66,0:27:43.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,并且再造{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and reclaim, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.41,0:27:49.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们失去的世界{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the world we lost.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.25,0:27:55.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,讲得不错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was a great speech.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.92,0:28:00.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,但根本就没有可替代的能源{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is no alternative power source.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.93,0:28:04.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,水坝是我们的唯一选择{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That dam is the only option.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.68,0:28:12.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,那只能跟他们拼了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, then, we fight them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.31,0:28:18.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有两周燃料就用完了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're two weeks away from running out of fuel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.48,0:28:19.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,最多能撑三周{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe three, tops.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.69,0:28:20.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.94,0:28:23.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,燃料一旦用完{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And once that happens, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.28,0:28:25.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就不能再拿着个扩音器上去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I won't be able to go out there with a bullhorn, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.37,0:28:28.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,指望他们平静下来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and calm everybody down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.87,0:28:32.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要电力让无线电发射机重新运作{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need that power to get the radio transmitter working.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.96,0:28:36.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是与外界取得联系的唯一办法{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's our only chance of reaching the outside world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.63,0:28:38.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得找到其他幸存者{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to find other survivors.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.67,0:28:41.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 幸存者不多了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. There's not that many of us left.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.55,0:28:44.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能再有人牺牲了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't afford any more casualties.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.63,0:28:47.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我们找到了这个地方{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We founded this place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.80,0:28:49.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我跟你 - 我知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You and I. - I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.18,0:28:53.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,靠能源才能让我们回到从前的日子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}On the idea that power would lead us back to the life we once had.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.56,0:28:57.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是我们不团结 也许就活不下来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we can't stick together, maybe we can't survive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.31,0:28:59.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我失去了一切{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I lost everything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.86,0:29:04.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,一想到会再失去身边仅有的…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The idea of losing what little I have is…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.66,0:29:09.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想回到那里去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to go back up there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.16,0:29:13.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说 给我三天时间{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen to me. Give me three days.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.04,0:29:15.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我跟他谈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me talk to him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.53,0:29:16.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,行不通的话 再按你说的做{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it doesn't work, then we do it your way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.83,0:29:18.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,万一适得其反 万一他暴怒了呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what if it backfires? What if he gets violent?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.67,0:29:22.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么知道他能明白你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, how do you know that he'll even understand you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.01,0:29:28.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不仅仅是只黑猩猩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's more than just an ape.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.35,0:29:32.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要带些人到尖兵堡{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna take some men up to fort point.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.02,0:29:34.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,去军械库找找看{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna go through the armory.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.56,0:29:37.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,看哪些还能用的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna see what's still working.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.02,0:29:40.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,三天{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three days.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.44,0:29:41.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是你三天还没回来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not back in three days, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.86,0:29:42.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就冲上去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}we're going up there, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.99,0:29:45.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他们杀到一只不剩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we're gonna kill every last one of them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.50,0:30:04.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡弗正在备车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carver is getting the trucks ready.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.17,0:30:06.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,他跟福斯特还有肯普马上就到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'll be here with Foster and Kemp any minute.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.63,0:30:09.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的要带上卡弗吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're really taking carver?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.35,0:30:10.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,他可开枪打了他们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, he shot one of them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.68,0:30:12.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也没办法{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't really have any choice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.10,0:30:14.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在水利部门工作过{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He used to work at the water department.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.35,0:30:16.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有他知道怎么让水坝运作起来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's the only one who knows how the dam works.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.56,0:30:20.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,马尔科姆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Malcolm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.06,0:30:23.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去了打算怎么做 打算说什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you gonna do up there? What are you gonna say?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.53,0:30:27.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会跟他说实话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll tell him the truth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.45,0:30:30.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望赶上他心情好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hope I catch him in a good mood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.00,0:30:38.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一定觉得我疯了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think I'm crazy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.12,0:30:40.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是担心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm worried.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.63,0:30:43.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 我也是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, so am I.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.80,0:30:47.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我仔细想了一遍{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've gone over it in my head, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.51,0:30:51.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是我连试都不试{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I think if I don't at least try this, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.89,0:30:54.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,那战争就真的无法避免了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}there's gonna be a war.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.41,0:31:18.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,把我也带上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take me with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.50,0:31:20.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人受伤怎么办 我可以帮忙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if someone gets hurt? You'll need me there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.04,0:31:26.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.71,0:31:29.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我需要你留在这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I need you to stay here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.63,0:31:33.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想留下亚历山大一个人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want Alexander to be alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.09,0:31:35.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm coming, too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.98,0:31:40.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,儿子 那里不安全{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Son, it's not safe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.69,0:31:43.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,待在你身边总比在这里安全{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'm safer with you than I am down here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.61,0:31:46.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm coming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.53,0:31:47.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.60,0:32:18.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,任何人都不许离开这辆车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one gets out of the trucks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.81,0:32:20.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,任何人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.85,0:32:22.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是我两个小时还没回来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I'm not back in two hours, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.78,0:32:24.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就带他们回城{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you get everyone back to the city.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.11,0:32:27.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会有事的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's gonna be okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.29,0:35:32.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 拜托{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please. Please. Please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.59,0:35:37.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,请别杀我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please don't kill me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.80,0:35:40.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,先听我说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just hear what I have to say.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.68,0:35:43.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.93,0:35:48.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,「不要再回来」 我知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Don't come back." I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.56,0:35:50.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来这里是因为…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wouldn't be here unless it were…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.48,0:35:52.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 好吧 好吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay! Okay! Okay!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.02,0:35:59.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 好 好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, okay, okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.61,0:36:03.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得带你去一个地方{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need to show you something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.57,0:36:04.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,离这不远{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not far.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.82,0:36:06.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,人类在撒谎{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Human lies!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.49,0:36:08.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.96,0:36:13.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 不 我发誓{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no. I swear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.59,0:36:19.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,去了你就明白了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I could just show you, then you'll understand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.09,0:36:20.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.69,0:36:43.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,带路{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Show me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.68,0:37:10.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是人类所谓的「小型水电站」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is what we used to call a "Small hydro".{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.56,0:37:13.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,本来是为这里以北的区域供电的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was built to service areas to the north of here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.48,0:37:16.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在试着把线路改装向城市供电{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we've been working to reroute the power lines to the city.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.81,0:37:18.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,城里核电站的能源{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because the city used to run off nuclear power, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.54,0:37:19.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,几年前就告竭了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but that ran out years ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.57,0:37:22.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些年一直靠柴油发电机和气化炉度日{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, we've been using diesel generators and gasifiers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.15,0:37:25.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,但要是能让这个水坝重新发电{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if we can just get this dam working, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.07,0:37:29.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,就可以将有限的化石能源贮存起来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}then we have a shot at restoring limited power.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.50,0:37:39.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能明白我的意思吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is any of this making any sense to you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.55,0:37:43.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,灯光{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The… lights.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.59,0:37:45.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.43,0:37:47.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,灯光{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The lights.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.85,0:37:50.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你的家园{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is your home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.56,0:37:53.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从没想过将它夺走 真的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I don't want to take it away from you, I promise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.39,0:37:58.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,但如果你允许我们在这里施工{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if you can allow us, let us do our work here…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.15,0:38:00.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还带了别人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You brought others?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.36,0:38:05.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,就几个人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just a few.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.70,0:38:08.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会造成任何威胁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not a threat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.70,0:38:10.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然的话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I am, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.87,0:38:13.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你随时可以杀了我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}then I guess you can kill me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.40,0:38:40.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.94,0:38:45.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 别慌 别慌{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, wait, wait! Stop, stop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.16,0:38:58.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得把枪给他们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to give them our guns.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.75,0:39:02.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这一个条件{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the one condition.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.50,0:39:04.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么意思{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What does that mean?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.51,0:39:07.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们能留下了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can stay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.23,0:39:25.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,人类有了电力就会变得更危险{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If they get power, they'll be more dangerous!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.73,0:39:27.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么要帮他们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why help them?!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.57,0:39:29.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们似乎已经走投无路了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They seem desperate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.45,0:39:33.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果赶走他们 以后一定会强攻过来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we make them go, they'll attack.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.45,0:39:35.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,来就来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.58,0:39:39.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,趁其疲弱 一举消灭他们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll destroy them while they're weak.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.04,0:39:43.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,有多少猿类得为此牺牲{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And how many apes will die?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.55,0:39:48.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是一个缔造和平的机会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have one chance for peace.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.22,0:39:52.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,让人类干完他们的活 他们就会离开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let them do their human work. Then they'll go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.43,0:39:56.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,人类干的活{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Human work?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.39,0:40:01.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,人类干的活{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Human work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.11,0:40:06.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,人类干的活{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Human work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.73,0:40:09.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,人类干的活{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Human work!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.61,0:40:49.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,科巴说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Koba say, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.28,0:40:51.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,猿族应该憎恨人类{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}apes should hate humans…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.53,0:40:52.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,够了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enough!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.90,0:40:55.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,科巴在人类身上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}From humans Koba learned hate, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.37,0:40:57.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,只学到了仇恨{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but nothing else.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.58,0:41:14.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得吃点东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, you need to eat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.84,0:41:16.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 我只是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, I just…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.97,0:41:19.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天你的所作所为十分勇敢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was brave, what you did today.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.31,0:41:28.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,马尔科姆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Malcolm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.23,0:41:30.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道现在所有人都指望着你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know everyone's depending on you…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.94,0:41:34.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才不在乎 我一点也不在乎{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't care about that. I don't care about any of that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.53,0:41:36.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只在乎他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I care about him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.78,0:41:40.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,他经历的都不是小孩应该经历的事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He saw things that no kid should see, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.81,0:41:42.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会让情况再次恶化了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I'm not letting us go back to that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.71,0:41:49.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.43,0:42:01.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也在试着消除和他的隔阂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have been trying to get closer to him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.60,0:42:04.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,但{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.81,0:42:06.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,总有一天会的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.86,0:42:14.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道猿类可怕在哪儿吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know the scary thing about them?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.07,0:42:17.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不需要电力 灯光{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They don't need power, lights.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.28,0:42:21.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,暖气 什么都不需要{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heat. Nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.20,0:42:22.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, pal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.08,0:42:23.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是猿类的优势{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's their advantage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.58,0:42:27.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,是他们比人类强大的原因{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what makes them stronger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.25,0:42:30.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,马尔科姆 今晚应该留一个人守夜{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Malcolm, I'm thinking one of us should stand guard tonight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.09,0:42:32.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿什么守 枪都被缴了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}With what? They took our guns.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.34,0:42:33.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们要真动了杀心 咱们根本活不到现在{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If they wanted us dead, we would be dead already.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.88,0:42:36.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们可能只是不着急动手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe they're just taking their time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.34,0:42:37.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,都已经干掉地球上一半的人了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They killed off half the planet already.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:38.34,0:42:39.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.34,0:42:40.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:40.47,0:42:42.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,这真不能怪猿类{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't honestly blame the apes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.31,0:42:46.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,那怪谁 本来就是猿流感{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who the hell else am I going to blame? It was the simian flu.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.10,0:42:47.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,那也是实验室里科学家创造出来的病毒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was a virus created by scientists in a lab.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.02,0:42:50.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,猩猩只是无辜的试验对象{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The chimps they were testing on didn't have a say in the matter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.81,0:42:52.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,别跟我扯大道理{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spare me the hippie-dippie bullshit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.69,0:42:54.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你敢说你看到他们时{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're telling me you don't get sick to your stomach{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.38,0:42:55.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,不觉得恶心吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}at the sight of them?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.03,0:43:01.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以前不还有个女儿吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Didn't you have a little girl?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.49,0:43:02.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡弗 够了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carver, that's enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.53,0:43:04.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她是怎么死的 - 够了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How did she die? - That's enough!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.37,0:43:05.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你老婆也是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or your wife, for that matter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.41,0:43:08.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡弗 再不闭嘴我就要揍人了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carver, you better shut up before I kick your ass.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.04,0:43:13.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.96,0:43:18.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,算我嘴贱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm the asshole.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.31,0:43:25.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.99,0:43:48.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你听起来生病了 还好吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sound sick… you OK?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.54,0:43:52.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是需要休息{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just need rest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.34,0:44:02.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你操心人类的事就好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You worry about the humans.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:03.11,0:45:04.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,科巴哪儿去了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's Koba?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.24,0:45:08.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,生闷气呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still angry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.20,0:45:13.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说要去打猎{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Said he was going hunting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:21.05,0:45:23.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,看 下面有人类{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, humans below!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.31,0:45:37.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们来这干什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are we here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.52,0:45:41.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯撒相信人类{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Caesar trusts humans.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.74,0:45:43.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,科巴可不信{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Koba does not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.36,0:45:47.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,大多数武器应该还能用{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Most of the arsenal seems functional.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:47.37,0:45:48.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.33,0:45:50.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们安排了人在那边试射{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're testing them out back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.92,0:46:41.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,别动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:41.29,0:46:44.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫你别动 懂吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't move, do you understand me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.22,0:46:46.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,特里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Terry!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.97,0:46:49.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,特里 快过来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Terry, get in here, quick!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.02,0:46:58.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我操{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holy shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.77,0:47:03.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么办 怎么办{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do we do? What do we do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.86,0:47:05.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,他从哪儿冒出来的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where did he come from?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:06.03,0:47:08.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 要杀了他吗 - 我也不知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Should we shoot him? - Maybe. I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.45,0:47:15.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还真他妈够丑的啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are one ugly son of a bitch, aren't you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:33.93,0:47:36.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,悠着点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:40.60,0:47:42.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想他应该是饿了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude, I think he's hungry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:42.27,0:47:44.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定是和别的猿类走散了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He must have gotten separated from the others.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.77,0:47:45.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你迷路了吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You lost?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:46.61,0:47:48.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,要回家吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trying to get home?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:49.78,0:47:52.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,滚吧 离开这里 蠢猴子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go on! Get out of here, stupid monkey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:52.62,0:47:55.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,快滚 照他说的做 快滚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go on. You heard him. Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.29,0:48:05.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些枪足够杀死所有的猿类了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enough guns here to kill every ape.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.63,0:48:08.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,必须警告凯撒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Must warn Caesar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:08.22,0:48:10.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,天知道山上那些人在搞什么鬼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who knows what humans are really doing up there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:30.15,0:48:32.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,堵住了 得炸开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gotta clear this blockage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.04,0:48:39.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道你曾有个女儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't know you had a daughter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:44.84,0:48:46.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:51.68,0:48:53.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,她叫什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was her name?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.18,0:49:00.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,莎拉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sarah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:04.69,0:49:06.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很遗憾{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm really sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.15,0:49:17.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在有你和你父亲陪着我 所以{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, now I have you and your dad, so…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:24.25,0:49:26.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.46,0:49:28.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好了 - 布置妥当了吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- All right. - You got all that straight?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:40.22,0:49:42.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,引线就那么长了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's all the wire we got.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:42.81,0:49:45.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,注意安全{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brace yourselves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:46.15,0:49:50.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,三 二 一{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three, two, one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:55.99,0:49:58.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 爸爸 - 马尔科姆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dad! - Malcolm!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.04,0:50:05.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,马尔科姆 马尔科姆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Malcolm! Malcolm!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:05.83,0:50:06.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:07.42,0:50:08.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看不到卡弗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't see Carver.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:32.57,0:50:33.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,轻点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:33.90,0:50:35.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 扶好了 - 好的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Leave it there. - I got it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:38.32,0:50:40.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,骨头没断{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not broken.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:41.49,0:50:44.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,松开 好的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let go. Good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:56.26,0:50:57.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:59.30,0:51:00.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你救了我们的命{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You saved our lives.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:01.43,0:51:02.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得把那一大堆碎石给清理掉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've got a lot of debris to clear now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:02.93,0:51:04.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能会耽搁久一点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We might need a bit more time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:04.14,0:51:05.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,多久{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:44.26,0:51:45.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好呀 小朋友{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, buddy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:54.36,0:51:56.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,干什么呢 弄好了吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing? Are you finished?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:59.45,0:52:00.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,看什么看{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you looking at?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:11.63,0:52:13.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,从箱子里滚出去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, get out of there!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:18.88,0:52:21.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 老子杀了你 - 卡弗 你干什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey! I'll kill you! - Carver, what're you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:25.89,0:52:27.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要 不要{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't! Don't!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:27.31,0:52:29.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯撒 不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Caesar, no!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:29.18,0:52:30.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:44.91,0:52:49.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,说过不准带枪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Said no guns!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:53.08,0:52:54.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 别这样 - 拜托{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, don't. - Please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:26.45,0:53:28.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我并不知情{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:35.33,0:53:38.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,人类 现在就走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Human leave now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:23.59,0:54:25.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,这下完蛋了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man, we screwed now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:28.89,0:54:30.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,马尔科姆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Malcolm?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:31.01,0:54:33.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,马尔科姆 你要去哪儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Malcolm, where are you going?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.18,0:54:34.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,马尔科姆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Malcolm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:40.57,0:54:43.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 拜托 我得和他谈谈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, please, I just need to speak to him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:46.07,0:54:49.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 都是我的错 我会让他离开的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry. That was all my fault. But I will make him leave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:49.78,0:54:52.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我的家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This my home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:54.29,0:54:56.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不该上这来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should not be here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:56.41,0:54:57.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I understand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:57.92,0:54:59.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,马尔科姆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Malcolm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:04.63,0:55:06.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,她病了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's sick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:08.22,0:55:10.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,她这样多久了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long has she been this way?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:17.98,0:55:20.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我带了药{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have medicine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:21.06,0:55:22.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,抗生素{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Antibiotics.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:25.24,0:55:26.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许她能帮上忙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe she can help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:28.91,0:55:32.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,不信你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do not trust you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:34.91,0:55:36.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能理解{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't blame you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:37.50,0:55:39.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,但请相信我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But believe me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:39.92,0:55:41.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们并不都像他那样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are not all like him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:41.75,0:55:46.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 让我们帮你吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, let us help you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:16.04,0:56:17.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,一天{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}One day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:19.50,0:56:22.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们只能待一天{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You stay one day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:23.50,0:56:25.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,父亲 不行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Father, no!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:25.05,0:56:27.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们需要更多的时间 - 就一天{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We might need more time. - One day!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:32.09,0:56:34.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,猿族会提供帮助{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ape will help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:37.85,0:56:40.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才不帮忙呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will not help!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:44.19,0:56:46.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你们疯了吧 - 把他带走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This is bullshit, man! - Get him out of here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:46.15,0:56:48.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,走 够了 过来 离开这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move! That's enough. Come on, get out of here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.99,0:56:50.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧 伙计{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:56.83,0:56:58.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,行了吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:59.58,0:57:01.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我过来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move, come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:06.50,0:57:08.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,上去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get in!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:23.02,0:57:25.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,明天见 混蛋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}See you tomorrow, asshole.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:30.19,0:57:33.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚从城市回来 人类十分危险{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just came from the city. Humans very dangerous!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:33.66,0:57:35.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯撒在哪儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is Caesar?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:39.37,0:57:42.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,和人类在一起{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}With the humans.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:47.50,0:57:49.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,亚历克斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yo, Alex.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:49.05,0:57:52.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个继电器坏了 另外找一个来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This relay's busted. See if there's another one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:52.30,0:57:53.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:14.78,0:58:16.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯撒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Caesar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:26.21,0:58:27.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 不 别{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! No, no, no, don't!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:27.88,0:58:29.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! No! No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:36.51,0:58:40.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯撒在哪儿 我要见他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where Caesar? Want Caesar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:40.35,0:58:42.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯撒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Caesar!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:58.32,0:59:02.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,人类攻击了你的子民{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Humans attack your sons.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:02.66,0:59:06.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还让他们留下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You let them stay!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:08.50,0:59:11.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,置猿族于危险之中{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put apes in danger!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:13.76,0:59:19.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯撒爱护人类却不顾猿族{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Caesar love humans more than apes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:20.85,0:59:26.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,不顾你的子民{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}More than your sons.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:13.19,1:00:14.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,猿族{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ape…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:15.65,1:00:17.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:17.49,1:00:19.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:19.36,1:00:21.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,同类{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ape.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:49.35,1:00:51.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,原谅我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forgive me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:25.47,1:01:27.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是我的孩子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are my son.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:29.22,1:01:31.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要你听我说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need you to listen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:43.61,1:01:47.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么不告诉凯撒人类试枪的事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't tell Caesar about the guns we found?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:50.25,1:01:52.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也不准说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Neither will you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:04.55,1:02:08.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你父亲不再信任我了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your father doesn't trust me now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:09.72,1:02:12.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得保护他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need to protect him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:12.93,1:02:18.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,他对人类的爱让他变得盲目{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}His love for humans makes him blind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:18.19,1:02:19.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:20.86,1:02:24.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要人类还在这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}As long as they are here, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:26.82,1:02:30.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就为凯撒的性命担忧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I fear for Caesar's life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:21.13,1:03:22.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,昨天的事谢谢了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}For yesterday.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:46.74,1:03:49.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,看 看这儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look. Look.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:49.16,1:03:50.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,看这儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:50.57,1:03:52.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:52.53,1:03:54.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是一个星期五{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"It was Friday."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:55.16,1:03:57.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个美妙的下午{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"A real nice afternoon."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:58.00,1:03:59.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,温暖{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Warm."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:02.92,1:04:05.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们外出{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"We were hanging…"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:05.88,1:04:08.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们外出郊游{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"We were hanging out…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:08.34,1:04:11.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,在水潭边上开了一场啤酒聚会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"At this kegger down at the swimming hole."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:13.26,1:04:15.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,外出郊游{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hanging out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:17.52,1:04:19.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,游玩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hanging.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:21.06,1:04:23.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里 你识字吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here. You can read?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:34.12,1:04:36.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可是好东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, this is the good stuff.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:38.71,1:04:40.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 干杯 - 干杯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Cheers. - Cheers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:47.26,1:04:49.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到底有什么毛病{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell is wrong with you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:49.23,1:04:51.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是让你滚回家吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought we told you to go home!{\r}
