Dialogue: 0,1:04:53.35,1:04:55.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 走开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:59.23,1:05:00.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他倒知道这个 - 是啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He understood that, didn't he? - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:16.62,1:05:18.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,他好像喜欢你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think he likes you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:18.16,1:05:19.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,得了吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:19.75,1:05:21.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 好吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, all right.{\r}
