Dialogue: 0,1:05:47.11,1:05:48.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,好喝吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's good, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:52.07,1:05:53.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 好了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:55.16,1:05:55.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,别激动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Easy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:55.99,1:05:56.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:56.87,1:05:58.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别激动 - 别激动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Easy. - Easy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:58.16,1:05:59.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:47.96,1:06:49.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,马尔科姆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Malcolm!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:49.79,1:06:51.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,马尔科姆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Malcolm!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:51.13,1:06:53.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了 发生什么事了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it? What happened?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:31.10,1:08:32.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,能用了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It worked.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:33.86,1:08:35.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少在这里能用了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}At least here it did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:35.90,1:08:38.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,城市那边要等回去了才知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll know when we get back to the city.{\r}
