Dialogue: 0,1:09:12.19,1:09:14.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Son of a bitch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:14.86,1:09:17.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,真他妈能干{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You son of a bitch!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:03.32,1:10:06.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,灯光{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The… lights.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:35.69,1:10:37.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,好些了吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Feeling better?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:14.64,1:11:17.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,母亲{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:28.63,1:12:30.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,人类的枪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Human gun!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:33.89,1:12:35.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,快逃{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run.{\r}
