Dialogue: 0,1:16:25.87,1:16:27.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你收到这条信息{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you are receiving this signal, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:27.91,1:16:29.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,请报上所在地 完毕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}please state your location. Over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:30.00,1:16:34.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,重复 这里是旧金山发报点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Repeat. This is San Francisco attempting to establish contact.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:34.05,1:16:35.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你收到这条信息{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you are receiving this signal{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:35.34,1:16:38.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,请报上姓名和所在地 完毕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}please state your identity and your location. Over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:39.63,1:16:40.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,出什么事了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:40.64,1:16:42.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,猿类袭击了武器库{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The apes attacked the armory, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:45.18,1:16:48.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉响警报 拉响警报{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sound the alarm! Sound the alarm!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:21.89,1:17:26.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,别让它们上墙 别让它们上墙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep them off the walls! Keep them off the walls!{\r}
