Dialogue: 0,1:17:36.90,1:17:38.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 准备好了吗 - 好了 长官{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You ready? - Yes, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:38.36,1:17:39.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:40.78,1:17:42.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen to me.{\r}
