Dialogue: 0,1:17:53.38,1:17:54.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们将击退它们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will push them back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:55.38,1:17:57.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,干掉他们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drive them down!{\r}
