Dialogue: 0,1:42:46.08,1:42:48.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经两天了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's been two days.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:54.54,1:42:56.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你儿子还没回来吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your son is not back yet?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:01.72,1:43:03.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是谁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who was that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:05.10,1:43:06.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,录像里那个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}On the video.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:09.47,1:43:12.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,是个好人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A good man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:15.69,1:43:18.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,像你一样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:48.85,1:43:50.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们必须偷偷上塔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They need to get to the tower without being seen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:50.85,1:43:52.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我带他走地下通道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna take him through the subway.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:53.60,1:43:54.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:55.31,1:43:58.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,科巴派人去接妇孺了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Koba sent for the females and young.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:58.73,1:44:01.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在来的路上了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're on their way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:01.61,1:44:03.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,母亲也会来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mother too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:04.45,1:44:06.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,必须马上走了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Must go. Now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:18.00,1:44:19.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:29.97,1:44:31.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,是谁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:31.97,1:44:34.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,是人类就出声{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you're human, you better say so!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:34.39,1:44:36.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我 我是马尔科姆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's me! It's Malcolm!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:36.39,1:44:37.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,别开枪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't shoot!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:39.77,1:44:41.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,从楼梯上去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take the stairs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:41.19,1:44:43.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,就能绕到街上去了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'll bring you around and up under the street, okay?{\r}
