Dialogue: 0,1:44:48.62,1:44:49.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:50.37,1:44:52.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,信任{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trust.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:59.25,1:45:01.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 我要出来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, I'm coming out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:01.34,1:45:03.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,别开枪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't shoot!{\r}
