Dialogue: 0,1:45:23.86,1:45:26.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都不知道你是否还活着{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't know if you'd made it out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:26.11,1:45:27.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,见到你真好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good to see you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:27.32,1:45:28.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:28.91,1:45:30.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会扭转局面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna turn all this around.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:30.62,1:45:32.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么意思 你们在干什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean? What's going on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:32.58,1:45:34.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,猿类占领了塔楼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The apes. They're all over the tower.{\r}
