Dialogue: 0,1:45:36.37,1:45:37.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续试{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep trying.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:37.50,1:45:39.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,马尔科姆 看这个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Malcolm, look at this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:40.38,1:45:43.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,C-4炸弹 每个五磅多{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}C-4. Five-pound blocks.{\r}
