Dialogue: 0,1:50:16.19,1:50:17.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们袭击了我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They attacked us!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:17.61,1:50:18.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为他们以为我们袭击在先{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because they thought we attacked them.{\r}
