Dialogue: 0,1:51:03.07,1:51:04.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,是杀害猿族{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill ape.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:04.49,1:51:06.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,科巴是为自己而战{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Koba fight for Koba.{\r}
