Dialogue: 0,1:52:50.35,1:52:51.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:12.66,1:55:13.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,猿族{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ape{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:14.70,1:55:16.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,不杀{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}not kill…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:17.54,1:55:18.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,同类{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}ape.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:44.35,1:55:46.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:48.36,1:55:50.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是猿类{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}not ape.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:54.03,1:55:55.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:09.94,1:57:11.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,放开他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leave him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:29.29,1:57:31.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们在这不安全{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not safe here.{\r}
