Dialogue: 0,1:57:43.47,1:57:45.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}has already{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:46.69,1:57:47.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}begun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:49.81,1:57:52.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,猿族挑起了战争{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ape started war.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:55.69,1:57:57.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,人类{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And human…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:59.82,1:58:02.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,人类不会宽恕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}human will not forgive.{\r}
